# Unreal Engine generated folders
Binaries/
Build/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/

# Packaged builds: ~1 GB of staged exe + pak that BuildCookRun regenerates in about a minute.
Packaged/

# GoodSky is a paid Fab marketplace pack and is NOT redistributed here — the README explains
# how to install it. Its absence is handled: the game mode logs a warning and falls back to the
# engine sky, so the project still builds and runs (with a plainer horizon).
Content/GoodSky/

